{
  "name": "[Util] Rotacao de Variaveis",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "trigger-manual",
      "name": "Quando executado manualmente",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [250, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "Injeta variáveis customizadas no texto usando sintaxe {{ variable_name }}.\n\nExemplos:\n- Entrada: \"Opa {{ nome }}, desconto de {{ percentual }}% esperando!\"\n- Variáveis: { \"nome\": \"João\", \"percentual\": \"50\" }\n- Saída: \"Opa João, desconto de 50% esperando!\"\n\nPassa \"message_text\" e \"variables\" (JSON object) como parâmetros.",
        "height": 250
      },
      "id": "input-note",
      "name": "Input Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noteDocumentation",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [450, 50]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "p1",
              "name": "message_text",
              "value": "={{ $input.first().json.message_text || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "p2",
              "name": "variables",
              "value": "={{ $input.first().json.variables || {} }}",
              "type": "object"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "params",
      "name": "Extrair Parâmetros",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [450, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const text = $json.message_text || '';\nconst vars = $json.variables || {};\n\nlet result = text;\n\n// Substitui {{ variavel }} por valor correspondente\nfor (const [key, value] of Object.entries(vars)) {\n  const pattern = new RegExp(`{{\\s*${key}\\s*}}`, 'g');\n  result = result.replace(pattern, String(value));\n}\n\nreturn {\n  original_text: text,\n  injected_text: result,\n  variables_applied: Object.keys(vars)\n};"
      },
      "id": "inject-variables",
      "name": "Injetar Variáveis",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [650, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "r1",
              "name": "message_text",
              "value": "={{ $json.injected_text }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "output-final",
      "name": "Output Final",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [850, 300]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Quando executado manualmente": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Extrair Parâmetros",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Extrair Parâmetros": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Injetar Variáveis",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Injetar Variáveis": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Output Final",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
